        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Big spoilers below, but since this is Ultimate MI I want to give&nbsp;more help to those that might need it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMint with everyone high teens/low 20s.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>First play of Missing Resources I targeted Tachyon. This discards all one-shots which A. Let me keep Parse's Buffer Overflow and B. Put 5 Bursts into Tachyon's Trash. Parse plays Buffer Overflow, and everyone else mostly puts out destroy ongoings/equipment fodder. Next MI turn, she plays a couple clue cards, then another Missing Resources. I used Buffer Overflow to discard it, which puts 4 more clues into play (good thing) plus a \"Threat\" to the President. She will flip with 4 clues out, so you can now destroy 2 clues safely.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter she flips, Parse should have a Reveal the Flaws or two and play that. Legacy should have a Take down and play that. Tachyon should have a Hypersonic Assault and play that. At this point, MI's Damage Reduction is gone, she can't play cards, and she can't deal damage. Tachyon with Insipiring Presence and Targeting Arrow plus Blitz means she did ~30 damage in one turn and MI dropped.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>~A-Kat</p>",
