        "created_at": "2020-12-08T18:12:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint, and I have no idea how. @_@ This wasn't exactly easy. That advice about who to Missing Resources is really good, I think I went for Bunker and lost a bunch of Limited cards. It took me quite a while to get through, and I ended up Sucker Punching her because Missing Memo was out. XD</p>",
